# ── lanthanides.io — example environment ─────────────────────────────────────
# No environment variables are required to build or run the site. Everything is
# derived from the versioned files in _data/, _elements/, and _articles/ at
# build time; there is no database and no external service.
#
# If a variable is ever added, document it here and keep the rule: `.env` is
# gitignored; never commit real credentials (CLAUDE.md hard rule #3).
